# INCLUDE ONLY NECESSARY FILES APPROACH
# This is a "blocklist" - ignoring everything except what we specifically need
# Start by ignoring the entire project
*
!api/index.py
!api/requirements.txt
!frontend/**
!vercel.json

# Add back only what we absolutely need
!.vercel/
!vercel-build.sh

# Ignore all Python cache
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/*$py.class